# Verify ChipLab

## Quick gate

```bash
node scripts/gate.mjs          # portable, ~10 checks
node scripts/gate.mjs --deep   # + Z3 formal + native bins (WSL on Windows)
```

The gate writes `reports/scorecard.json` and prints `scorecard: N% (n/m)`.
Never weaken a test to make the gate pass; fix the cause or record the limit.

## RTL and formal (Linux/WSL)

```bash
make lint
python tb/itch_model.py --count 100000 --out tb/vectors
make sim VECTORS=tb/vectors
make formal
./formal/solver_matrix.sh
python -m pytest -q tb/test_model.py
python tb/run_cocotb.py
python tb/run_pipeline_cocotb.py
python tb/run_skid_cocotb.py
```

Expected: 0 lint warnings, 50k/1M records with 0 mismatches, Z3 PASS,
cocotb pipeline and skid tests PASS. Ubuntu runners use Icarus for cocotb
(Verilator/cocotb ABI mismatch); local WSL can use Verilator.

## WASM / web / API / MCP

```bash
node scripts/wasm_smoke.mjs && python scripts/check_wasm_fixture.py
node backend/run.mjs --compare --count 100000
node mcp/client_smoke.mjs
node scripts/test_cloud_api.mjs
node scripts/build_vercel.mjs && node scripts/test_vercel_api.mjs
node scripts/release_check.mjs
```

## Rules

- No claim without a command and a report under `reports/`.
- Multi-frame MoldUDP64 back-pressure is still open (R1): do not report it as fixed.
- No Fmax/tapeout claim without LibreLane/OpenSTA output.
=====RELEASE=====
---
name: chiplab-release
description: Cut a ChipLab release correctly - bump one version, rebuild artifacts, run the gate, update 
CHANGELOG/README, create a tag and let the Release workflow publish EXE/npm/PyPI/SBOM/checksums. Use when asked to 
release, bump the version, tag, or prepare GitHub assets.
---

# Cut a ChipLab release

## 1. Bump the one version

```bash
node scripts/version.mjs --set 0.4.0
```

This updates `package.json`, `packages/npm/package.json`, `native/Cargo.toml`,
`wasm-core/Cargo.toml`, `packages/python/pyproject.toml`, the WASM ABI version,
`mcp/server.mjs`, `api/_core.mjs` and `scripts/sbom.mjs`.

## 2. Rebuild the WASM (ABI + web + npm copies)

```bash
npm run build:wasm
cp wasm-core/target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/chiplab_core.wasm web/wasm/
cp web/wasm/chiplab_core.wasm packages/npm/wasm/
```

`version()` is `(major<<16)|(minor<<8)|patch`; the UI prints all three parts.

## 3. Update docs, then gate

- `CHANGELOG.md`: new `## X.Y.Z - date` section (Keep a Changelog). This becomes the
  GitHub release notes.
- `README.md`: version references and any changed behavior.
- `reports/sbom.json`: `node scripts/sbom.mjs` (regenerate).

```bash
node scripts/gate.mjs --deep      # must be 100%
node scripts/release_check.mjs    # version/changelog/README/SBOM/artifacts
```

## 4. Build the artifacts locally (optional pre-check)
